    "title": "Juniper Ridge safe stay area for homeless could stay open into 2027 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Central Oregon Daily News Staff ,\n4 hours ago BEND, Ore. -- The Juniper Ridge Temporary Safe Stay Area for homeless residents could remain open into 2027. Nearly 200 people are living in the area just off Highway 97 north of Bend. The original plan was to gradually it and then close it off completely by the end of 2026. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
